{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118112332116-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118113351\"/><p>深圳主辦今屆的APEC峰會。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>亞太經合組織（APEC）第33次非正式領導人會議周三（18日）至周四（19日）在中國深圳舉行，俄羅斯總統普京、南韓總統李在明、澳洲總理阿爾巴內塞、泰國總理阿努廷等外國領袖周三陸續抵達深圳，準備出席峰會。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:45:01.630041+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:23:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:01.171906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:38:32.096345+00:00","content_hash":"b89810e1c5bb025e3e870ee62080044eaea621a7d02e49915d0f6a8291f2aff8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}